  "en": "Teachers in primary education in the reported school year. A workforce level; national reporting definitions can vary. Missing raw observations are not filled during dataset generation. The app can interpolate between observations or carry endpoint values for up to three years, with provenance labels; countries without usable data remain unavailable. Categories and subsets can overlap, so metrics must not be added together.",
